% PowerPoint slides 29.
### Parse Tree
...
- **{{color=emp|Internal nodes}}:** nonterminals.
...
- **{{color=emp|Leaves}}:** terminals (or ε for an empty production).
...
- **{{color=emp|Edges}}:**
...
  - From the nonterminal on the LHS of a production.
...
  - To the nodes on the RHS of that production.
...
A parse tree captures a derivation of the string.
---
