% PowerPoint slides 88–89.
### Eliminating Ambiguity
[intro] @(84, 174) {size=30px, w=1112px} Solution: change the grammar so operators associate left.
[oldhead] @(84, 247) {size=30px, w=480px, color=id} Original grammar
[newhead] @(700, 247) {size=30px, w=490px, color=emp} Revised grammar
